      "text": "[9:12PM] #OguduAlapere #TrafficUpdate \n\nDescending Gbagada bridge and Olopomeji connecting Car Wash, Ifako, Ogudu down to Estate Alapere is a smooth journey.\n\nFrom Estate Alapere moving towards Ojota bridge down to Ikosi junction is a good movement.\n\nIkosi junction connecting Tollgate, Secretariat down to Otedola bridge is better.\n\nReturn journey from Otedola bridge connecting Secretariat, Tollgate down to Car Wash is perfectly okay.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
